{title: Head of Meraioth}
{subtitle: Nehemiah 12:15; 12:12–21; 12:1–15}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 115}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [G7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Dm7] [G7] |
| [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] [G7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb6] [G7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F7]In the [Bb]days of Joiakim [Gm7]the high priest stood
[Cm7]Heads of the fa[F7]thers houses in [Dm7]the city found
[Gm7]From the exile we re[Cm7]turned [F7]to the [Bb]rebuilt place
To keep [Gm7]the order [Cm7]of the sacred [F7]grace
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Of Ha[Eb6]rim Adna is [F7]named in the list
[Bb]Of [Eb]Meraioth Helkai is the [F7]priest
Of the [Dm7]line of Merajot he [G7]leads the way
[Cm7]In the days of Joiakim [F7]each day
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Jes[Eb6]hua fa[F7]thered Joiakim [Bb]in [Gm7]the [Bb]record clear
[Gm7]Eliashib then [Cm7]Joiada through the [F7]years
[Dm7]Jonathan [Gm7]and Jaddua fol[Cm7]low in [F7]line
[Bb]Serving the tem[Gm7]ple in Je[Cm7]rusalem's [F7]shrine
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Of Ha[Eb6]rim Adna is [F7]named in the [Bb]list
Of [Eb]Meraioth Helkai is the [F7]priest
Of the [Dm7]line of Merajot he [G7]leads the way
[Cm7]In the days of Joia[F7]kim each day
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Seraiah [Eb6]and Jeremi[F7]ah had their [Bb]own [Gm7]heads [Cm7][F7][Dm7][G7][Cm7]
[F7]Mera[Eb]iah and Hananiah stan[F]ding in steads
Ezra [Dm7]had Meshullam Amari[G7]ah had his own
[Cm7]Jehohanan serving in [F7]the holy throne
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]Malluch had Jonat[F7]han Shebaniah had Jo[Bb]seph
Harim [Gm7]had Adna [Cm7]keeping the prom[F7]ise
[Dm7]Meraioth had [Gm7]Helkai in [Cm7]the book [F7]of Nehemi[Bb]ah
Preser[Gm7]ving the priest[Cm7]ly line for the fami[F7]ly [Eb6]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F7]Of Ha[Bb]rim Adna is named in the list
Of [Eb]Meraioth Helkai is the [F7]priest
Of the [Dm7]line of Merajot he [G7]leads the way
[Cm7]In the days of Joia[F7]kim each [Eb][F7]day
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Of [Bb]Meraioth [F7]Hel[Cm7]kai is the priest
[F7]Head of the [Bb]fa[F7]thers houses [Cm7]in the [F7][Bb]light
{end_of_verse}

